Hello Robert Samuel White,

Please see attached correspondence regarding  your public records request. =
I have also attached a Fee Waiver/Reduction Request form, which are welcome=
 to complete and return for consideration. We are able to accept payment by=
 check or money order only.

Below are the links provided in the attached correspondence:

  *   The Oregon Attorney Generals Public Records and Meetings Manual (curr=
ent edition 2024)
     *   Attorney General's Public Records and Meetings Manual 2024 - Orego=
n Department of Justice<https://www.doj.state.or.us/oregon-department-of-ju=
stice/public-records/attorney-generals-public-records-and-meetings-manual/>=
 - There is a link to the PDF version
     *   This includes information on how exemptions are applied, including=
 the public interest balancing test for conditional exemptions.
     *   This includes, in combination with other listed links, information=
 regarding fee assessments and fee waivers.
  *   DAS Fee Policy
