<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Hello Robert Samuel White,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Please see attached correspondence regarding&nbsp; y=
